  "amendments": [
    {
      "amended": "15 stays alive as the frozen_baseline fixture positive control; the live Phase 252 count is derived from the ledger (frozen baseline minus retired). After the D-40 retirement of subscription_detail||populated full mode is 14 Phase 252 cells and 151 Phase 253 cells.",
